This library provides convenient access to the Fanbasis Checkout REST API from server-side TypeScript or JavaScript.
The full API of this library can be found in api.md.
It is generated with Stainless.
npm install @fanbasis/checkout-sdk
The full API of this library can be found in api.md.
import FanbasisCheckout from '@fanbasis/checkout-sdk';
const client = new FanbasisCheckout({
 apiKey: process.env['FANBASIS_CHECKOUT_API_KEY'], // This is the default and can be omitted
 environment: 'sandbox', // defaults to 'production'
});
const checkoutSession = await client.checkoutSessions.create();
console.log(checkoutSession.data);
This library includes TypeScript definitions for all request params and response fields. You may import and use them like so:
import FanbasisCheckout from '@fanbasis/checkout-sdk';
const client = new FanbasisCheckout({
 apiKey: process.env['FANBASIS_CHECKOUT_API_KEY'], // This is the default and can be omitted
 environment: 'sandbox', // defaults to 'production'
});
const checkoutSession: FanbasisCheckout.CheckoutSessionCreateResponse =
 await client.checkoutSessions.create();
Documentation for each method, request param, and response field are available in docs
